 up again from various sources, the answers are below (please tell if you d=
isagree):</div><div><br clear=3D"none"></div><div><b><u>YES!</u></b></div><=
div><ul><li>Non-ambiguous grammar (~=3D monoparsing, machine parsable)<br c=
